{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Plentiful",
    "steam_appid": 3044790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the world to channel water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture animals and plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your tribe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing god game, shaping the map by stacking stones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water flows over the landscape and needs to be caught in ponds and lakes.<br>Trees placed near water will flourish and produce food. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruit, Vegetables and Animals are eaten by your tribe of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone stacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volcanoes, Lightning, Floods, Locusts, Earthquakes, Plagues, Fire</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the world to channel water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture animals and plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your tribe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing god game, shaping the map by stacking stones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water flows over the landscape and needs to be caught in ponds and lakes.<br>Trees placed near water will flourish and produce food. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruit, Vegetables and Animals are eaten by your tribe of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone stacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volcanoes, Lightning, Floods, Locusts, Earthquakes, Plagues, Fire</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Stack stones to shape the world. A relaxing game about harnessing nature.",
